{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Defence is an idle-farming simulator with defence content. This game is designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while your farm is woking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/f25e55df04f270f5bc7ef6bc79bb8eeb.avif?t=1757557664\" data-has-big width=1560 height=861 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Grow Crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, use your drone to automatically grow crops. Better crops will cost some money to seed, but will give more fuel to activate your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Produce Fuel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use crops to produce fuel to run your turrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/5c5c00c6db536d5a534f6863df057c5c.avif?t=1757557664\" width=1560 height=556 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c7Defend your Farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies will run to your town hall every few minuets. Place turrets to defend your town hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don`t worry. There is no game over in this game. When your town hall is broken, all zombies will disappear and you can try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853400/extras/81682b8de3614764efcfc9a20d3facc0.avif?t=1757557664\" width=1560 height=940 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853400?t=1757557664","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853400?t=1757557664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto